   "notes": "1.2.0 Phase 5 P2.1: thin shell (627 lines, was 1,866) hosting one card per platform-specific MigrationAdmin: Integrations/RtMedia/MigrationAdmin.php (394), Integrations/MediaPress/MigrationAdmin.php (278), Integrations/BuddyBoss/MigrationAdmin.php (453). Shell owns menu entry, page UI, per-card JS, AJAX dispatcher (mvs_migration_batch / mvs_migration_reset); each MigrationAdmin owns detection, count, run_batch, album-creation, and platform-specific helpers (e.g. rtMedia activity rewriting). Shared base class: Integrations/AbstractMigrationAdmin.php."
  }
