  "phpstan_level": 5
 },
 "coding_rules": [
  "Same standards as Free (PHP-ORGANIZATION-RULES.md, NAMING-RULES.md)",
  "Rule 1: never use current_user_can() with a custom-ability slug",
  "Rule 2: REST permission_callback must not use the bare '__return_true' (allowlist enforced in bin/coding-rules-check.sh)",
  "Rule 3: never import a Free CONCRETE class directly (use container or filter hooks; the only acknowledged exception is MediaRepository \u2014 Phase 1 added MediaRepositoryInterface + TemplateHelpersInterface to retire even that)",
  "Rule 4: platform-coupled code lives under includes/Integrations/<Platform>/ (never under capability-named subdirs like Storage/, AI/, Connectors/Flickr/)",
  "Rule 5 (added 2026-05-02, Phase 6): every wp_ajax_* registration is on the documented 5-handler allowlist (mvs_pro_test_s3, mvs_pro_test_bunny, mvs_save_connector_prefs, mvs_migration_batch, mvs_migration_reset). Off-list registrations fail the gate; new functionality must use a REST route. Each allowlisted registration must carry an inline `Rule A allowlist:` comment.",
  "Rule 6 (added 2026-05-03, RC walkthrough): every block render.php that instantiates a WPMediaVersePro\\Frontend\\Layouts\\* class MUST call $layout->enqueue_assets() in the same file. WordPress does NOT auto-enqueue per-layout stylesheets when the block path is taken \u2014 only the LayoutManager site-wide path does. Idempotent (wp_enqueue_* dedupes by handle), so it does not double-enqueue when the LayoutManager site-wide path also runs.",
  "Feature toggles required \u2014 every new Pro feature gated by get_option('mvs_*_enabled')",
  "CLI importer base class \u2014 the 3 importers (Integrations/{RtMedia,MediaPress,BuddyBoss}/Importer.php) extend WPMediaVersePro\\Integrations\\AbstractBatchImporter (Phase 5 P2.2). New importers go under includes/Integrations/<Platform>/Importer.php (Rule 4) and extend the base.",
  "Admin migration card pattern \u2014 each platform-specific MigrationAdmin extends WPMediaVersePro\\Integrations\\AbstractMigrationAdmin (Phase 5 P2.1); the generic Admin/MigrationPage shell hosts one card per registered MigrationAdmin and dispatches AJAX by platform slug",
  "Admin page pattern follows Free (no standalone admin pages outside WPMediaVerse menu)",
  "Layout interface contract \u2014 every layout in Frontend/Layouts/ implements LayoutMode::render_feed(array $args = []): string (Phase 3a). Returns ONLY the feed body markup \u2014 never get_header()/get_footer() \u2014 so blocks + shortcodes can embed the output anywhere."
 ],
